  "translation": "Yesterday afternoon, I went from home to the library together with a friend. On the way, I met a friend. We walked in together. The library inside was very quiet. We found two books. Then we sat by the window and read. Later, I asked him: 'What time are you going home?' He said: 'I haven't decided yet.' We read continuously until five o'clock in the afternoon. Then we went home together. Today is really a good day."
